      "value": "<blockquote><p>Manipulate Forces of Life and Death</p></blockquote><p>Warriors of Mercy manipulate the life force of others. These Monks are wandering physicians who nonetheless bring a swift end to their enemies, often wearing masks to present themselves as faceless bringers of life and death.</p><h3>Warrior of Mercy Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.qoVrpjIZE2r2d5Sj]{Hand of Harm}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.5dopxV7nfuCmHgiB]{Hand of Healing}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.lfHGeKM34AfaEeIM]{Implements of Mercy}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.z53LIvu2BpR9kMhY]{Physician's Touch}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.kBvklIegsxCok9P1]{Flurry of Healing and Harm}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.XAr0Sj87HGDTmVpX]{Hand of Ultimate Mercy}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
